---
// CaseStudies Component
---
<section id="projects" class="py-28 border-t border-slate-900 px-6 max-w-7xl mx-auto">
    <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-end justify-between mb-16">
        <div>
            <h2 class="text-xs font-semibold tracking-widest uppercase text-emerald-400 mb-3">Track Record</h2>
            <p class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight text-white">Selected Case Studies</p>
        </div>
        <p class="text-slate-400 text-sm max-w-md mt-4 md:mt-0">
            Explore how we have partnered with market leaders to rebuild brand architectures and engineer high-performance systems.
        </p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-8">
        <!-- Case Study 1 -->
        <div class="p-8 rounded-2xl bg-slate-900/40 border border-slate-800/85 hover:border-slate-700 transition-all flex flex-col justify-between group">
            <div>
                <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-6">
                    <span class="text-xs font-semibold tracking-wider uppercase px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-emerald-500/10 text-emerald-400 border border-emerald-500/20">FinTech Platform</span>
                    <span class="text-xs text-slate-500 font-mono">2026</span>
                </div>
                <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-3 group-hover:text-emerald-400 transition-colors">Nexus Financial Core</h3>
                <p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-6">
                    Complete digital transformation including brand repositioning, full-stack microservices architecture, and high-concurrency payment pipeline integration handling over $50M in monthly volume.
                </p>
            </div>
            <div class="pt-6 border-t border-slate-800/80 flex flex-wrap gap-2 text-xs text-slate-300">
                <span class="px-3 py-1 rounded-md bg-slate-900 border border-slate-800">Next.js</span>
                <span class="px-3 py-1 rounded-md bg-slate-900 border border-slate-800">TypeScript</span>
                <span class="px-3 py-1 rounded-md bg-slate-900 border border-slate-800">AWS / Docker</span>
                <span class="px-3 py-1 rounded-md bg-slate-900 border border-slate-800">Brand Re-design</span>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Case Study 2 -->
        <div class="p-8 rounded-2xl bg-slate-900/40 border border-slate-800/85 hover:border-slate-700 transition-all flex flex-col justify-between group">
            <div>
                <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-6">
                    <span class="text-xs font-semibold tracking-wider uppercase px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-emerald-500/10 text-emerald-400 border border-emerald-500/20">SaaS Growth</span>
                    <span class="text-xs text-slate-500 font-mono">2025</span>
                </div>
                <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-3 group-hover:text-emerald-400 transition-colors">Veloce Cloud Analytics</h3>
                <p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-6">
                    Engineered a real-time analytics dashboard from scratch accompanied by a comprehensive inbound marketing strategy and technical SEO restructure that yielded a 240% lift in organic customer acquisition.
                </p>
            </div>
            <div class="pt-6 border-t border-slate-800/80 flex flex-wrap gap-2 text-xs text-slate-300">
                <span class="px-3 py-1 rounded-md bg-slate-900 border border-slate-800">React</span>
                <span class="px-3 py-1 rounded-md bg-slate-900 border border-slate-800">Python / FastAPI</span>
                <span class="px-3 py-1 rounded-md bg-slate-900 border border-slate-800">Technical SEO</span>
                <span class="px-3 py-1 rounded-md bg-slate-900 border border-slate-800">CRO Strategy</span>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>